title: "layout-benchmark-big-maps"
abstract: "Grouping and recursive layout of big pathway maps in SBML: competing grouping strategies scored by one rulebook, and the layout algorithms of layout-benchmark applied at every level of the resulting grouping. From BioHackathon Europe 2026, project 22 (Open Pathway Maps)."
